	(text "Low-side heater stage: VOUT_12V -> R1(10k) / R2(10k) divider sets VGS~=6V on Q1 (keeps within VGS_max of AO3400-class FETs even on VOUT spikes). VOUT_12V -> H1 -> H2 -> F1 -> R_HTR -> H2 -> H1 -> Q1 series path. H1/H2 also carry heater NTC (TH2) to RX_NTC."
